<view class="container appointment-page">
  <view class="intro card">
    <view class="intro-badge">AI 智能审核</view>
    <view class="intro-title">先定使用方式，再看实时房态</view>
    <view class="intro-note">自习与其他用途采用不同占用规则：自习可在 A101/A102 共享，其他用途则独占房间。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">1 · 预约日期</view>
  <view class="card form-card">
    <picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{minDate}}" end="{{maxDate}}" bindchange="onDateChange">
      <view class="date-picker">{{date}} <text>›</text></view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">2 · 使用方式</view>
  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="mode-grid">
      <view class="mode-option {{usageMode === 'study' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="study" bindtap="chooseUsageMode">
        <view class="mode-title">自习共享</view>
        <view class="mode-note">A101 / A102 可多人共享；系统优先集中安排，节约空间。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="mode-option {{usageMode === 'exclusive' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="exclusive" bindtap="chooseUsageMode">
        <view class="mode-title">非自习独占</view>
        <view class="mode-note">会议、活动、音乐等用途；同一时段房间只服务一笔预约。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">3 · 选择连续时段</view>
  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="slot-tip">每个按钮代表 30 分钟。继续点击相邻按钮可延长预约。</view>
    <view class="slot-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{slotItems}}"
        wx:key="index"
        class="slot-button {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}} {{item.disabled ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
        data-index="{{item.index}}"
        bindtap="tapSlot"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="duration" wx:if="{{durationText}}">已选 {{durationText}} · 30 分钟粒度</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title" wx:if="{{selectedSlots.length}}">4 · 实时房间状态</view>
  <view class="card form-card" wx:if="{{selectedSlots.length}}">
    <view class="allocation-note" wx:if="{{allocationNote}}">{{allocationNote}}</view>
    <view class="room-loading" wx:if="{{availabilityLoading}}">正在读取该时段房间状态…</view>
    <view class="room-grid" wx:else>
      <view
        wx:for="{{rooms}}"
        wx:key="room_code"
        class="room-option {{item.stateClass}} {{selectedRoom === item.room_code ? 'selected' : ''}}"
        data-room="{{item.room_code}}"
        bindtap="chooseRoom"
      >
        <view class="room-head">
          <view><text class="room-code">{{item.room_code}}</text><text class="recommend" wx:if="{{item.recommended}}">系统优先</text></view>
          <text class="room-state">{{item.state_text}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="room-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
        <view class="room-meta" wx:if="{{item.capacity_hint}}">参考容量：{{item.capacity_hint}} 人</view>
        <view class="room-meta" wx:if="{{item.occupancy_mode === 'study_shared'}}">当前自习人数：{{item.study_people}}；剩余容量：{{item.remaining_capacity}}</view>
        <view class="room-meta">适合：{{item.suitableText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="no-room" wx:if="{{!availabilityLoading && rooms.length && freeRoomCount === 0}}">当前方式下没有可用房间，请调整时段、人数或使用方式。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">5 · 使用信息</view>
  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="label">人数</view>
    <input class="input" type="number" value="{{peopleCount}}" maxlength="3" placeholder="请输入实际人数" bindinput="onPeopleInput" />
    <view class="label purpose-label">具体用途</view>
    <textarea class="textarea" value="{{purpose}}" maxlength="1000" auto-height="false" placeholder="请写清具体事项；只有“开会”“自习”等过短理由会被驳回" bindinput="onPurposeInput" />
    <view class="counter">{{purposeLength}} / 1000</view>

    <view class="example-title">可以这样写</view>
    <view class="examples">
      <view class="example" wx:for="{{examples}}" wx:key="*this" data-text="{{item}}" bindtap="useExample">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    <view class="notice-title">房态与审核是两道规则</view>
    <view wx:if="{{usageMode === 'study'}}">已有自习不会把 A101/A102 整间锁死，只要仍有容量就可以继续预约；系统会优先把自习同学集中到同一间房。</view>
    <view wx:else>非自习用途为独占使用；若 A101/A102 已有自习，页面会直接显示“仅自习可继续预约”，无需等 AI 审核后才发现冲突。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary submit-btn" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交预约申请</button>
</view>
